{
"file": 871,
"paths": [
"d008/d086/f016"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "c703a40d",
"en_raw": "...That is called synchronicity"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "91374351",
"en_raw": "or"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "e8e821d2",
"en_raw": "also, 'synchronicity'"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "eb64e4b4",
"en_raw": "as they say"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "7cc8cfb2",
"en_raw": "By the way, may I ask"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "7812a942",
"en_raw": "what are you kids doing"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "b4fd02e2",
"en_raw": "in a dark place full of mosquitoes"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "a747e50f",
"en_raw": "like this?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "be520226",
"en_raw": "Oh, we meet again"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "aae794dc",
"en_raw": "...In a place like this"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "a747e50f",
"en_raw": "like this?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "5d9d4e9a",
"en_raw": "Heh heh~n"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "95aedcae",
"en_raw": "This is a secret"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "399287d2",
"en_raw": "A secret from middle schoolers"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "3ce78466",
"en_raw": "in the forest..."
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "4cc866d3",
"en_raw": "Hmm, I'm curious"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "122264ee",
"en_raw": "We can't talk"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "72017224",
"en_raw": "to strange men"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "46e9cf3c",
"en_raw": "Ah, yes, quite right..."
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "e2d2aca9",
"en_raw": "You have a very well"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "26f53133",
"en_raw": "brought-up household"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "a60e8491",
"en_raw": "...But I'm not"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "610fe3c5",
"en_raw": "suspicious at all"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "acd97059",
"en_raw": "I run a barbershop"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "f211cb12",
"en_raw": "It's in front of Hirumi Station"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "3d7fef8b",
"en_raw": "so you may know it?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "9c515849",
"en_raw": "No"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "2e80211f",
"en_raw": "Being unable to prove who I am"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "0ce4da95",
"en_raw": "is a problem"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "099f5932",
"en_raw": "...I thought 'the barber by the station'"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "01eeac12",
"en_raw": "would be enough?"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "872044f9",
"en_raw": "You don't know it?"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "369959c1",
"en_raw": "How unfortunate..."
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "ebc710ea",
"en_raw": "...A barber?"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "f581f565",
"en_raw": "Kurumi, snip snip"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "2dc747fd",
"en_raw": "knows barbers"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "543580d1",
"en_raw": "Ah, good"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "2b67cc70",
"en_raw": "So now you and I"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "b6bfde52",
"en_raw": "can be called acquaintances"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "0bc44948",
"en_raw": "Acquaintances~"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "19944998",
"en_raw": "Anyway"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "c936503f",
"en_raw": "If I may ask something odd"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "f3c024f9",
"en_raw": "May ask~"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "d842a85d",
"en_raw": "What are you kids doing"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "a747e50f",
"en_raw": "like this?"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "42d3f47c",
"en_raw": "here?"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "c2f98231",
"en_raw": "Looking for"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "bb4c09bc",
"en_raw": "the okra treasure~"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "c906fc59",
"en_raw": "...Oh"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "6ebe8377",
"en_raw": "There seems to be a story here"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "882ddfc6",
"en_raw": "...A treasure hidden in the forest..."
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "f72dc481",
"en_raw": "How do you know?"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "2a5b607c",
"en_raw": "Shiina"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "e87aa55f",
"en_raw": "...Ah, Shiina!"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "1751b06b",
"en_raw": "You can't say that..."
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "8089d8f9",
"en_raw": "Idiot Nao"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "6ad8c21e",
"en_raw": "What are you doing, piling it on!"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "762b81c0",
"en_raw": "Aha, I see"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "e7bc8fd0",
"en_raw": "...So then"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "69428a2e",
"en_raw": "No..."
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "d190b783",
"en_raw": "did you find the treasure?"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "1a157f66",
"en_raw": "The treasure is a secret"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "9dc2e5e2",
"en_raw": "so Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "c9e695b2",
"en_raw": "will get scolded by Sango..."
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "eedc5e84",
"en_raw": "Now now, come come"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "d94b43af",
"en_raw": "fighting is not good"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "6f4abd4a",
"en_raw": "You won't find it, I'd say"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "f1cdf99e",
"en_raw": "In the first place"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "a33f174c",
"en_raw": "No way!"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "240a5015",
"en_raw": "the treasure rumor is a hoax"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "5bf6fc8a",
"en_raw": "Ah, sorry about that..."
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "f7aceff7",
"en_raw": "You see, actually I"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "4e0af657",
"en_raw": "did it"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "7f295c9d",
"en_raw": "I showed a neighborhood kid"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "ac97f647",
"en_raw": "my handwritten map"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "81758bbf",
"en_raw": "and said there's treasure"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "f0470204",
"en_raw": "buried in this forest..."
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "d305827e",
"en_raw": "This is my old"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "d9f17658",
"en_raw": "party trick"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "36eeda18",
"en_raw": "...Maybe the timing"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "c1cdf4a8",
"en_raw": "was too good"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "9d94b9ec",
"en_raw": "My wife yelled at me"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "47faef21",
"en_raw": "that middle schoolers are taking it seriously"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "bfcbc2e5",
"en_raw": "I thought, come on"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "408db20e",
"en_raw": "they can't be that simple"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "8e0a01dd",
"en_raw": "No way..."
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "a2425a49",
"en_raw": "You see, Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "309db74c",
"en_raw": "The secret treasure is secret, but"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "2bd5227f",
"en_raw": "Kurumi found something good"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "5e1b7e92",
"en_raw": "...Do you want to hear it?"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "db2237b1",
"en_raw": "I'd love to hear it"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "ef42d62c",
"en_raw": "It's a wa-ter-fall!"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "9acf52f8",
"en_raw": "...Amazing, you know?"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "40f0de6c",
"en_raw": "A waterfall in Tsukazato Forest?"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "5f3c5fb5",
"en_raw": "I was born and raised"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "74e97743",
"en_raw": "in this town"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "36fddb07",
"en_raw": "but I don't know of a waterfall"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "1e37dff6",
"en_raw": "...In fact"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "01a0aff7",
"en_raw": "given the terrain of the lower Tama River basin"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "d958f634",
"en_raw": "it's implausible"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "f9c2e522",
"en_raw": "There was one"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "63220a2b",
"en_raw": "Kurumi saw it"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "7dcbfa35",
"en_raw": "Aha"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "d7f47f5d",
"en_raw": "Then how about this?"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "0f521a42",
"en_raw": "The mysterious waterfall you saw"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "6372c1f0",
"en_raw": "was the phantom forest's treasure..."
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "14ccf4d2",
"en_raw": "Truly nature's mystery"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "fbb83926",
"en_raw": "That makes"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "15edf1e9",
"en_raw": "a nice punchline"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "5cde091a",
"en_raw": "Well, then, that's that"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "7c0d9aa2",
"en_raw": "What's that?"
}
]
}